{"schema":1,"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.PrincGen:24:17","name":"pg_index","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/PrincGen.lean","lines":[24,30],"atlasRow":412297,"chapter":"1.5992","archiveCommit":"40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005","provenance":{"fileSha256":"61c35790be33f00ee6a74c8871d0e4fc269a7c2b04bb18cf42beb8e42b44484a","commandSha256":"3fa37e4f4515a8c34ba4bf47fd7699fc492241490609fa93bdd1b8b7c322bf18"},"source":["private theorem pg_index {l : ℕ} [Fact l.Prime] {a : ℕ} (ha : 0 < a) :","    (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l a).index = l ^ (a - 1) * (l - 1) := by","  have hl : l.Prime := Fact.out","  haveI : NeZero (l ^ a) := ⟨pow_ne_zero _ hl.ne_zero⟩","  have hker : KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l a = (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow l a).ker := rfl","  rw [hker, Subgroup.index_ker, MonoidHom.range_eq_top.mpr (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow_surjective a),","    Subgroup.card_top, Nat.card_eq_fintype_card, ZMod.card_units_eq_totient, Nat.totient_prime_pow hl ha]"],"statementLines":[24,25],"proofLines":[25,30],"assume":["Assume `0 < a` (ha)."],"show":"For a prime ℓ and natural a > 0, the subgroup of ℤℓ-units congruent to one modulo ℓᵃ has index ℓ^(a − 1)(ℓ − 1) in the full unit group.","strategy":"Count the units in the quotient modulo ℓᵃ.","steps":[{"id":"g-26-3","number":"⟨1⟩1","kind":"have","claim":"Since ℓ is prime and a > 0, the prime-power totient is φ(ℓᵃ) = ℓ^(a−1)(ℓ−1).","lines":[26,26],"headLines":[26,26],"snippet":"  have hl : l.Prime := Fact.out","uses":[],"refs":[],"typedFact":"l.Prime","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-27-3","number":"⟨1⟩2","kind":"have","claim":"Since the prime ℓ is nonzero, the modulus ℓᵃ is nonzero.","lines":[27,27],"headLines":[27,27],"snippet":"  haveI : NeZero (l ^ a) := ⟨pow_ne_zero _ hl.ne_zero⟩","uses":[],"refs":[],"typedFact":"NeZero (l ^ a)","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-28-3","number":"⟨1⟩3","kind":"have","claim":"The principal units Pₐ are precisely the kernel of the unit reduction homomorphism ℤℓˣ → (ℤ/ℓᵃ)ˣ.","lines":[28,28],"headLines":[28,28],"snippet":"  have hker : KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l a = (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow l a).ker := rfl","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.LeNuIffPowMemPrinc:10:19","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/LeNuIffPowMemPrinc.lean","lines":[10,11],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.7227"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.LeNuIffPowMemPrinc:16:19","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/LeNuIffPowMemPrinc.lean","lines":[16,16],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.7227"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l a = (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow l a).ker","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-29-3","number":"⟨1⟩4","kind":"rewrite","claim":"The index of the kernel of reduction equals the size of its image. Unit reduction is surjective, so [ℤℓˣ:Pₐ] = |(ℤ/ℓᵃ)ˣ| = φ(ℓᵃ) = ℓ^(a−1)(ℓ−1), using a > 0.","lines":[29,30],"headLines":[29,30],"snippet":"  rw [hker, Subgroup.index_ker, MonoidHom.range_eq_top.mpr (KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow_surjective a),\n    Subgroup.card_top, Nat.card_eq_fintype_card, ZMod.card_units_eq_totient, Nat.totient_prime_pow hl ha]","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.UnitsMapSurjOfZmod:32:9","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.redPow_surjective","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/UnitsMapSurjOfZmod.lean","lines":[32,33],"atlasRow":424222,"owner":"1.7227"}],"refs":["g-26-3","g-28-3"],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]}],"uses":[],"counts":{"steps":4,"leaves":4,"parents":0,"secondRead":0,"typedFacts":3,"proofLines":6},"coverage":{"leaf":[[26,30]],"parent":[],"statement":[[25,25]],"introduction":[]},"component":"cohomology","chapterTitle":"Twisted cokernels in a cyclotomic tower","notePlace":{"item":"l:princ","where":"Lemma 8.3(a)","page":13,"dest":"theorem.8.3","name":"pg_index","key":"pgIndex"}}
